{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:03 2026-10-15 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:03 2026-10-15 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:03 2026-10-15 HKT</p><img alt=\"連接中國與北韓的新鴨綠江大橋今日正式開通。央視新聞\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9129574287f6808c51c4758472712c33/2026-10/544_-_2026-10-15T111121_510.jpg\"/><p>央視新聞報道，今天上午，中朝新鴨綠江大橋開通儀式舉行。<br/>新鴨綠江大橋連接中國遼寧省丹東市和朝鮮平安北道新義州市，它位於鴨綠江大橋下游12公里處，橋寬28.5米、雙向4車道，橋體長3.026公里，包括聯絡公路總長預計為20.4公里。<br/> </p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:36.124662+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T03:03:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T08:18:23.960099+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:10.314730+00:00","content_hash":"634193e58d7e88366bef24ac9b87c08c48e91591b3218efa64f13581d3d5390b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}